# Rytmix Web — environment variables (template)
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values for local development.
# `.env.local` is gitignored; THIS file (.env.example) is committed as documentation.
#
# Only PUBLIC config belongs in the frontend. The `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix means the
# value is inlined into the client bundle at build time — so it is NOT a secret.
# Never put DB connection strings, the Jamendo key, or the JWT signing key here;
# those live only in the backend (Render env vars). See ../Rytmix-v2-Plan.md.

# Base URL of the Rytmix ASP.NET Core API. Read by src/lib/api.ts.
#   - Local dev: the API running on your machine (e.g. http://localhost:5139)
#   - Production: your Render/custom API domain (e.g. https://api.rytmix.com)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5139
